; The payee and tag blocks and the apply directive close their keyword
; chains the same way as the commodity and account blocks (issue #3260):
; an unrecognized keyword is an error, with or without an argument.

payee Grocer
    alais   Grocery Store

payee Bakery
    uid

tag Receipt
    chek    value =~ /^[0-9]+$/

apply acount Personal

apply acount

test bal -> 5
__ERROR__
While parsing file "$FILE", line 6:
Error: Unrecognized payee directive 'alais'
While parsing file "$FILE", line 9:
Error: Unrecognized payee directive 'uid'
While parsing file "$FILE", line 12:
Error: Unrecognized tag directive 'chek'
While parsing file "$FILE", line 14:
Error: Unrecognized directive 'apply acount'
While parsing file "$FILE", line 16:
Error: Unrecognized directive 'apply acount'
end test
